  { day: 2, title: 'Murchison Falls Game Drive', body: 'Early morning game drive along the north bank of the Nile. Search for lions, Rothschild\'s giraffes, elephants, buffaloes, Jackson\'s hartebeests and Uganda kobs. Return for breakfast. Afternoon at leisure or optional guided walk to the top of the falls. Dinner and overnight Murchison.' },
